  {
    "id": "7c0c19b7-6d9f-55a1-bae0-e976865c945d",
    "pack": "war-of-immortals",
    "kind": "equipment",
    "slug": "equipment:final-scalecloak",
    "name": "Final Scalecloak",
    "level": 20,
    "rarity": "unique",
    "traits": ["artifact", "invested", "magical", "mythic"],
    "sources": [
      {
        "kind": "book",
        "book": "war-of-immortals",
        "aon": "https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=3508"
      }
    ],
    "description": [
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Fashioned from a swath of Mogaru's red-and-black hide and trimmed with Agyra's rough scales in green, blue, and white, this cloak draws upon the power of both kaiju, but at considerable cost. Any kaiju within a 5-mile radius of the "
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Final Scalecloak",
            "marks": ["emphasis"]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " can sense the presence and nature of the item, and can also determine whether it's being worn by a mortal. This sense grows stronger as the item and kaiju near one another, until the kaiju can pinpoint exactly where the cloak is and who currently possesses it."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "When worn, the "
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Final Scalecloak",
            "marks": ["emphasis"]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " grants you resistance 15 to physical and precision damage, immunity to electricity, and a Fly speed of 60 feet. You are unaffected by strong winds while flying."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "rule"
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Activate—Commune with Kaiju",
            "marks": ["strong"]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " "
          },
          {
            "type": "action-cost",
            "cost": "two"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " (concentrate, manipulate, primal)"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Frequency",
            "marks": ["strong"]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " once per day"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Effect",
            "marks": ["strong"]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " Spend a Mythic Point; you gain the effects of a 6th-rank "
          },
          {
            "type": "ref",
            "id": "b9c6ff5d-7757-5750-8536-1486fd82c8a7"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " spell but can use it only to communicate with Gargantuan animals and beasts. Most kaiju are hostile toward you for wearing the "
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Final Scalecloak",
            "marks": ["emphasis"]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": ", however, requiring great effort to calm them enough to have a conversation."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "rule"
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Activate—Embody the Storm",
            "marks": ["strong"]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " "
          },
          {
            "type": "action-cost",
            "cost": "two"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " (concentrate, manipulate, primal)"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Frequency",
            "marks": ["strong"]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " once per hour"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Effect",
            "marks": ["strong"]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " Spend a Mythic Point; a nimbus of crackling electricity surrounds you for 1 minute. You gain a +4 status bonus to AC against ranged projectiles that are at least partly made of metal. If a foe attempts to Strike you with an unarmed attack or melee attack with a weapon at least partly made of metal, that creature takes "
          },
          {
            "type": "damage",
            "instances": [
              {
                "formula": "3d10",
                "damageType": "electricity"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " damage ("
          },
          {
            "type": "check",
            "statistic": "save:reflex",
            "dc": 40,
            "basic": true
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " save)."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "ref",
            "id": "3a625e82-9fd7-5921-88a5-28353b541701"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "rule"
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Destruction",
            "marks": ["strong"]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " The "
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Final Scalecloak",
            "marks": ["emphasis"]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " is torn to shreds if the wearer is struck by an attack or effect from both Agyra and Mogaru within the same round."
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
    "rules": [
      {
