  {
    "id": "74cc5bf4-5af4-5cfa-9c20-80a32f7b8a1b",
    "pack": "war-of-immortals",
    "kind": "equipment",
    "slug": "equipment:wandering-pipe",
    "name": "Wandering Pipe",
    "level": 11,
    "rarity": "unique",
    "traits": ["artifact", "invested", "magical", "mythic"],
    "sources": [
      {
        "kind": "book",
        "book": "war-of-immortals",
        "aon": "https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=3513"
      }
    ],
    "description": [
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "This long-stemmed pipe always emits a thin plume of smoke, even when not lit or in active use. The exact material the pipe is made of varies in every accounting; sometimes made of polished oak, other times ebony, sometimes stone, and in one Erutaki legend the pipe is made of pure ice that somehow holds a flame. Though the "
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "wandering pipe",
            "marks": ["emphasis"]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " is not intelligent, it is rumored to possess a certain capriciousness, leaving the possession of mortals whose lives are not exciting enough but inevitably finding its way back to its one true owner."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "When held in one hand, the pipe grants its holder a +2 circumstance bonus to Deception checks but imposes a -1 circumstance penalty to Stealth checks made to Hide or "
          },
          {
            "type": "ref",
            "id": "7e4e48de-b626-5513-9518-73261c58b5f4"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": ", as its telltale plume of smoke gives away the bearer's position."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Activate—Smoky Protections",
            "marks": ["strong"]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " "
          },
          {
            "type": "action-cost",
            "cost": "two"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " (concentrate, manipulate, primal)"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Frequency",
            "marks": ["strong"]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " once per hour; "
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Cost",
            "marks": ["strong"]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " 1 Mythic Point"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "rule"
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Effect",
            "marks": ["strong"]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " For the next 10 minutes, smoke gathers around you buoying your steps and protecting you. For the duration of this effect, you gain a fly Speed equal to your land Speed and automatically hover in place, and you have concealment from ranged attacks."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "ref",
            "id": "d1223d06-3950-584b-b8c5-ad53b206f69f"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "rule"
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Destruction",
            "marks": ["strong"]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " The "
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "wandering pipe",
            "marks": ["emphasis"]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " can be broken as easily as any other wooden pipe, but it always reforms afterward in the hands of the Immortal Trickster or one of his bonded mortals. It can only be broken by the hands of one of the Trickster's bonded mortals who is an honest person acting with good intent; it is said that if this occurs, the Trickster would also be significantly weakened as a result."
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
    "rules": [
      {
        "key": "FlatModifier",
        "selectors": ["skill:deception"],
        "type": "circumstance",
        "value": 2
      },
      {
        "key": "FlatModifier",
        "selectors": ["skill:stealth"],
        "type": "circumstance",
        "value": -1
      }
    ],
    "externalIds": {
      "foundry": "Compendium.pf2e.equipment-srd.Item.5BzfYgmQ4m39R4wz"
    },
    "data": {
      "bulk": "negligible",
      "usage": {
        "type": "held",
        "hands": "one"
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": "65f0a9bb-a088-532b-a192-d8750ebf8c31",
    "pack": "war-of-immortals",
    "kind": "equipment",
    "slug": "equipment:worldforge",
    "name": "Worldforge",
    "level": 25,
    "rarity": "unique",
    "traits": ["artifact", "invested", "magical", "mythic"],
    "sources": [
      {
        "kind": "book",
        "book": "war-of-immortals",
        "aon": "https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=3511"
      }
    ],
    "description": [
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Mounted upon a base of iron, inscribed with innumerable runes, this immense anvil can be used to forge nearly anything into reality. Stories claim that even metaphorical and abstract concepts, including \"a graveknight's mercy\" and \"the tears of a living wildfire\" have been hammered into solid shape upon "
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Worldforge",
            "marks": ["emphasis"]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": ", though the tales disagree about what form those objects took."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "The cost of using "
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Worldforge",
            "marks": ["emphasis"]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": ", however, is prohibitive for mere mortals. In addition to the fuel and metal it consumes, "
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Worldforge",
            "marks": ["emphasis"]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " draws upon the user's physical and spiritual strength to sustain the act of creation. The demand of its magic is such that no one save gods, or those who are nearly gods, can use it and survive."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "rule"
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Activate—Wondrous Forge",
            "marks": ["strong"]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " (downtime, manipulate)"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Requirements",
            "marks": ["strong"]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " You have the ability to make a Crafting check at mythic proficiency (such as that granted by the Artisan's Calling)"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Effect",
            "marks": ["strong"]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " After spending 2 days setting up the work (or 1 if you have the desired item's formula) and supplying "
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Worldforge",
            "marks": ["emphasis"]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " with adequate raw materials (as determined by the GM), you attempt to Craft something upon it. The DC and final cost of the item is also determined by the GM. For each day you spend Crafting, you must expend a Mythic Point or your "
          },
          {
            "type": "ref",
            "id": "fa3d4a94-c2f9-519b-b0a3-82d2612e188b"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " condition increases by 1; this condition can't be reduced until you have finished Crafting the item or you abandon the project. Each day spent Crafting upon the "
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Worldforge",
            "marks": ["emphasis"]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " counts as 10 days of normal Crafting time. If the value of your drained condition reaches 4, you must attempt a "
          },
          {
            "type": "check",
            "statistic": "save:fortitude",
            "dc": 46
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " save or die. If you fail this save or if you abandon the activity, what remains of your project shatters irrecoverably into a multitude of useless fragments."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "rule"
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Destruction",
            "marks": ["strong"]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " "
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Worldforge",
            "marks": ["emphasis"]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " can't be destroyed as long as "
          },
          {
            "type": "ref",
            "id": "353363db-a5c9-5093-a83d-5091fea2308d"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " maintains his divinity."
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
    "rules": [],
    "externalIds": {
      "foundry": "Compendium.pf2e.equipment-srd.Item.Im3tgXhR9W1CGaHo"
    },
    "data": {
      "bulk": 15,
      "usage": {
        "type": "held",
        "hands": "one"
      }
    }
  }
]
